{
  "version": 14,
  "variables": [],
  "tiles": {
    "0": {
      "content": "### Metrics Pipeline Comparison\n\nCompares two data paths for **controller acceleration** (`controller_accel_magnitude`).\n\n| Path | Source | Resolution | Best for |\n|------|--------|------------|----------|\n| **Dynatrace Metrics** | `timeseries` DQL | ~1 min (aggregated) | Trends, alerting, long-term storage |\n| **Bizevents (HD)** | `fetch bizevents` DQL | ~10ms (every data point) | Full-fidelity replay, peak detection |\n\n**Key takeaway:** The same 100Hz source data looks completely different depending on how it reaches Dynatrace. Metrics aggregate away peaks; bizevents preserve every gesture.\n\n-----",
      "type": "markdown"
    },
    "1": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Metrics: Acceleration (1-min avg)",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "timeseries accel = avg(controller_accel_magnitude), by:{serial}",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["accel"],
            "timestamp": "timeframe"
          },
          "leftYAxisSettings": {
            "isLabelVisible": true,
            "label": "Acceleration (g)"
          },
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Bizevents: Acceleration (full 100Hz)",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch bizevents\n| filter event.type == \"com.joustmania.acceleration\"\n| filter metric.name == \"controller_accel_magnitude\"\n| fields timestamp, serial, accel = metric.value\n| sort timestamp asc",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 10000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["accel"],
            "timestamp": "timestamp"
          },
          "leftYAxisSettings": {
            "isLabelVisible": true,
            "label": "Acceleration (g)"
          },
          "connectNulls": true,
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "content": "### Side-by-Side Detail\n\nMetrics (left) show smoothed 1-min averages. Bizevents (right) show every individual reading — peaks, valleys, and micro-gestures that metrics miss entirely.\n\n-----",
      "type": "markdown"
    },
    "4": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Metrics: Peak Acceleration",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "timeseries peak = max(controller_accel_magnitude), by:{serial}",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["peak"],
            "timestamp": "timeframe"
          },
          "leftYAxisSettings": {
            "isLabelVisible": true,
            "label": "Peak (g)"
          },
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Bizevents: Per-Axis Acceleration",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch bizevents\n| filter event.type == \"com.joustmania.acceleration\"\n| filter metric.name == \"controller_accel_x\" or metric.name == \"controller_accel_y\" or metric.name == \"controller_accel_z\"\n| fields timestamp, serial, axis = metric.name, value = metric.value\n| sort timestamp asc",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 10000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["value"],
            "seriesField": "axis",
            "timestamp": "timestamp"
          },
          "leftYAxisSettings": {
            "isLabelVisible": true,
            "label": "Acceleration (g)"
          },
          "connectNulls": true,
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "content": "### Data Density & Fidelity\n\nHow many data points each path delivers per minute, and event counts over time.\n\n-----",
      "type": "markdown"
    },
    "7": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Metrics: Samples/min",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "timeseries accel = avg(controller_accel_magnitude) | fieldsAdd last = arrayLast(accel) | fields last",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "singleValue",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "singleValue": {
          "recordField": "last",
          "labelMode": "none",
          "trend": { "isVisible": true }
        }
      }
    },
    "8": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Bizevents: Events/min",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch bizevents\n| filter event.type == \"com.joustmania.acceleration\"\n| filter metric.name == \"controller_accel_magnitude\"\n| summarize count = count(), by:{interval = bin(timestamp, 1m)}\n| sort interval desc\n| limit 1\n| fields last = count",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "singleValue",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "singleValue": {
          "recordField": "last",
          "labelMode": "none",
          "trend": { "isVisible": true }
        }
      }
    },
    "9": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Bizevents Volume Over Time",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch bizevents\n| filter event.type == \"com.joustmania.acceleration\"\n| filter metric.name == \"controller_accel_magnitude\"\n| summarize events = count(), by:{interval = bin(timestamp, 1m), serial}",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["events"],
            "timestamp": "interval"
          },
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "davis": {
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true },
        "enabled": false
      },
      "title": "Metrics: Avg vs Max Acceleration",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "timeseries avg_accel = avg(controller_accel_magnitude), max_accel = max(controller_accel_magnitude)",
      "querySettings": {
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "enableSampling": false,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "maxResultRecords": 1000
      },
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "chartSettings": {
          "fieldMapping": {
            "leftAxisValues": ["avg_accel", "max_accel"],
            "timestamp": "timeframe"
          },
          "leftYAxisSettings": {
            "isLabelVisible": true,
            "label": "Acceleration (g)"
          },
          "legend": { "hidden": false },
          "truncationMode": "end"
        },
        "thresholds": []
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "content": "### Summary\n\n| | Dynatrace Metrics | Bizevents (HD) |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Source** | OTEL → Dynatrace metrics ingest | OTEL → dtbizevents exporter → bizevents ingest |\n| **Resolution** | ~1 min (aggregated by Dynatrace) | ~10ms (every data point preserved) |\n| **Samples/min** | 1 (aggregated) | ~6,000 per controller |\n| **Storage cost** | Low (standard metrics) | Higher (log/bizevent ingestion) |\n| **Catches peaks?** | Only within 1-min max aggregation | Every peak, valley, and micro-gesture |\n| **Best for** | Trends, alerting, long-term analysis | Full-fidelity replay, motion forensics |\n| **Retention** | Metrics retention (default 3y) | Bizevent retention (configurable) |\n\n**When to use Metrics:** Alerting on sustained high acceleration, capacity planning, SLO tracking.  \n**When to use Bizevents:** Investigating specific player movements, debugging death detection thresholds, replaying exact game moments.\n\n-----",
      "type": "markdown"
    }
  },
